      <h2 class="section-title reveal">The Story<br>So Far</h2>
      <p class="about-text reveal">I'm <strong>Agastya Singh Rathore</strong>, a 14-year-old content creator from Jaipur, Rajasthan. While most people my age are still figuring things out, I'm already working with global automotive brands, growing a real social following, and telling stories people actually watch.</p>
